              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Use this API endpoint if one wants to retrieve a list of Services.\nA use case could be to view the service id of a Service.\n\nFor more information on Application Resources please access the https://developer.ibm.com/apis/catalog/instana--instana-rest-api/Applications#application-resources."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bundled": true
}